+ - **Proposed Change** - What will happen
+ - **Risk Level** - LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH/CRITICAL
+ - **Rollback Plan** - How to undo
+ - **Deadline** - When response needed by
+ - **Log Reference** - Link to full logs
